  id: Desert_Cabin_2
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 2"
  content: "\tI dropped a glass today. It didn't fall immediately. It drifted \u2014
    hovered in the air for a moment, slow as a feather \u2014 then landed and shattered.\r\n\n\tMy
    wife and I just looked at each other. Neither of us said anything."
